# Refyne Search Environment Variables
# Add these to Vercel project settings → Environment Variables

# Serper API Key (Google Search)
# Get from: https://serper.dev/
REFYNE_SERPER_KEY=your_serper_api_key_here

# DeepSeek API Key (LLM for extraction)
# Get from: https://platform.deepseek.com/
REFYNE_DEEPSEEK_KEY=your_deepseek_api_key_here

# Note: These keys are managed centrally by Refyne
# Never expose to clients or add to provider_connections table
# Only needed on Vercel (Next.js runtime), not Railway (worker)
